title: "Borg - Tiny GPU"
abstract: "A RISC-V SoC with a GPU featuring vertex shading, rasterization, and RGB fragment shading, targeting both iCE40 FPGAs and ASICs. Funded by NLnet NGI0 Commons Fund (SkyWater 130nm and IHP SG13G2 Tapeouts)."
